      "version": "2.6.6",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "text": "TriggerFish Prog Sequencer 303 smoke test\n\nThis is the tuned, reverb-equipped smoke-303 signal path with Foundry replaced by TfProgSequencer. The complete 16-bar Gibber Acid line is the short program visible in the sequencer: i for 8 bars, -iv for 4, then -V for 4.\n\nThe test deliberately uses repetition, rests, slides, sparse accents, an octave mark, derived patterns, mode replacement, and concatenation as a syntax litmus test. Select an output device in Audio-8 and start with monitor volume low."
      },
